- [中文：嵌套挂载——共享可读、写入范围独立](https://github.com/zehongye-gaga/CubeSandbox/blob/fix/944-deterministic-host-mount-order/docs/zh/guide/persistent-storage.md#嵌套挂载共享可读写入范围独立)

