```go
vc, err := jsoniter.Marshal(allMnts)
if err != nil {
    return nil, fmt.Errorf("marshal restore mounts: %w", err)
}
```

(Note: this copies a pre-existing pattern from `generateSandboxVirtiofsOpt` at line 89 — the same concern applies there.)

